flowchart TD
    %% Change request process, as a team would draw it on a wiki page
    start([Request comes in]) --> triage{Is it a bug?}
    triage -->|yes| repro[Reproduce locally]
    triage -->|no| scope[Write a short scope]

    subgraph dev [Development]
        repro --> fix[Fix and add a test]
        scope --> build[Build the change]
        fix --> pr[Open pull request]
        build --> pr
        pr --> ci{CI green?}
        ci -->|no| rework[Fix the failures]
        rework --> ci
    end

    subgraph release [Release]
        ci -->|yes| review{Review approved?}
        review -->|changes requested| rework
        review -->|approved| merge[Merge to main]
        merge --> notes[Write release notes]
        notes --> tag[Tag the version]
    end

    tag --> done([Shipped])

    classDef decision fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c90
    class triage,ci,review decision
